## Critical Gotchas

1. **Always use `nanoid(12)`** for field/choice/column IDs (not nanoid())
2. **Clone before mutation** to prevent state bugs
3. **Update mentions** when field titles change (regex replace)
4. **Serialize HTML** before API calls (`htmlUtils.serialize()`)
5. **Handle nested fields** in every field operation (check `parentId`)
6. **Version tracking** triggers sync - increment only on field mutations
7. **Navigation logic** only works forward (prevents infinite loops)
8. **GROUP fields** need ID regeneration for all nested fields on duplicate

